{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29197","headline":"赠所知 · 许浑","name":"赠所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因钓鲈鱼住淛河，挂帆千里亦相过。\n茅檐夜醉平阶月，兰棹春归拍岸波。\n湖日似阴鼍鼓响，海云才起蜃楼多。\n明时又作闲居赋，谁荐东门策四科。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}